    "created_at": "2021-08-14T20:33:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-08-14T20:33:15Z",
    "body": "I think that's a different issue.  If Chrome sees a content-length for a resource with a chunked transfer encoding, I believe it ignores the content-length.\r\n\r\nThat comment was about the fact that if we see content-length that matches uncompressed content-length, we'll consider that a success, if decompression results in a file that exactly matches the content-length size.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
