    "updated_at": "2021-08-16T10:15:15Z",
    "body": "If I understand correctly detecting whether the server is sending extra bytes is only a problem with HTTP/1.1 keep-alive connections? I don't think there is a perfect solution to this without modifying the HTTP spec in some way.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
