    "body": "> and could theoretically have extra bytes on the wire, which I think corresponds to the case this is trying to consider an error\r\n\r\nBut that at least is possible to detect, i.e. wait for connection close to determine whether extra bytes were sent or not. In the keep-alive case I don't think there is even a theoretical solution to this problem.",
