    "updated_at": "2021-08-16T10:29:19Z",
    "body": "That may introduce hangs in the case of currently cross-browser functional servers that expect browsers to close non-keepalive connections that specify lengths (which may be an uncommon enough case that it's fine to do, but is definitely a potentially breaking change)",
